WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.409
Jim Agnew, Screenwriter: Ideas are a great
testing ground with people, too.

00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:09.860
This is for more commercial-type films but
if you can pitch an idea in two to three sentences

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:13.849
to somebody (just your friends or whoever)
and they kind of do this weird thing I’ve

00:00:13.849 --> 00:00:16.380
noticed…this is when you know have a good
idea, not when people go “That’s great.”

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.510
But when they think about it for about three
seconds and they go “Ooh, that’s good!”

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.300
That is when you know it is actually connecting
with people.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.040
So if you have an idea and you say that to
ten people and they kind of all go “Ooh?”

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.899
Or they ask you about it again later, you
know it’s a good idea.

